sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Developer / CI Runner
    participant UI as Next.js Dashboard
    participant API as Express API Server
    participant Queue as BullMQ (Redis)
    participant Worker as Background Worker
    participant Critic as Critic Agent
    participant AST as AST Engine
    participant Coder as Coder Agent (Gemini 3.1)
    participant Sandbox as Docker Sandbox
    participant Mongo as MongoDB

    User->>UI: Dispatch Self-Heal (Repo, Branch, Trace)
    UI->>API: POST /api/pipeline/dispatch
    API->>Mongo: Create AnalysisRun (QUEUED)
    API->>Queue: Add job to 'hydra-pipeline-queue'
    API-->>UI: Return runId & connect SSE stream
    
    Queue->>Worker: Pick up job
    Worker->>Critic: Analyze Stack Trace
    Critic->>Critic: Extract File & Line Coordinates
    Critic-->>Worker: Target isolated (e.g., calculator.js:5)
    
    Worker->>AST: Parse file symbols & call graph
    AST-->>Worker: Nodes & Links hierarchy
    
    Worker->>Coder: Synthesize minimal verified patch
    Coder->>Coder: KeyRotator invoke gemini-3.1-flash-lite
    Coder-->>Worker: targetContent + replacementContent
    
    Worker->>Sandbox: Apply patch and run test command
    Sandbox->>Sandbox: Spin up Docker container (node / python / maven)
    Sandbox-->>Worker: Exit Code 0 (Test Suite Passed)
    
    Worker->>Mongo: Update AnalysisRun (COMPLETED)
    Worker-->>UI: SSE Event: Pipeline COMPLETED + Patch Review
    UI-->>User: Render Verified Patch & AST Call Graph
